### Feature RoleUsers — asignar / retirar / reactivar (JWT + RBAC)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000

# @name loginAdmin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sesion/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "admin",
  "password": "Admin123!"
}
###
@adminToken = {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.access_token}}

### Listar asignaciones
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/asignaciones-rol
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Obtener asignación
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/asignaciones-rol/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Asignar rol (user_id=2 SELLER, role_id=1 ADMIN) — 409 si ya existe
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/asignaciones-rol
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": 9,
  "role_id": 2
}

### Usuario inexistente -> 404
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/asignaciones-rol
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": 99999,
  "role_id": 1
}

### Desactivar asignación
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/asignaciones-rol/1/deactivate
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Permisos efectivos del usuario
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/usuarios/2/permisos
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Reactivar asignación
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/asignaciones-rol/1/reactivate
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 401 — sin token
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/asignaciones-rol
